on the long journey to the top! Will you lift your fellow mudmen up in the struggle, or feed the abyss…?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>High-Stakes Exploration</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/extras/6765e272dda29c9a03b76e95b1179856.poster.avif?t=1782414623\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/extras/6765e272dda29c9a03b76e95b1179856.webm?t=1782414623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/extras/6765e272dda29c9a03b76e95b1179856.mp4?t=1782414623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter The Heights; a vast vertical world of nooks, crannies, perils and punishment. To navigate its many chasms and false peaks is never without risk, with long falls and hard landings at every turn. Explore by yourself or with friends, if you trust them enough…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Soulslike &amp; Fighting-Game Fusion Combat</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/extras/32cfbac0e3969e8c474121ad7c0c7a23.poster.avif?t=1782414623\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/extras/32cfbac0e3969e8c474121ad7c0c7a23.webm?t=1782414623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/extras/32cfbac0e3969e8c474121ad7c0c7a23.mp4?t=1782414623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons featuring unique moves, stats and special inputs mean a lot of options for creating your own build, letting you tackle the challenging boss fights and enemy-filled levels in your own way. If you’re looking to fight fair and square, challenge other players with the dueling system!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Personality Based RPG System</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/extras/afc39d0d1a68d369e090d8ffeccec189.poster.avif?t=1782414623\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/extras/afc39d0d1a68d369e090d8ffeccec189.webm?t=1782414623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/extras/afc39d0d1a68d369e090d8ffeccec189.mp4?t=1782414623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you Refined or Crude? Mettlesome or Guileful? Level four double-sided attributes based on the classical humours according to your personality, and combine 200+ equipment items with your choice among 90+ unique weapons to express your skill in style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Features:</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punishment-Platforming-Action-Climbing-Adventure-RPG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Foddian Soulslike means no Game Over screen. Get knocked out? Get back up again!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tough challenges combining the original Jump King’s charged jumping with a combat-system inspired by Soulslikes and Fighting-Games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic multiplayer system where players encounter each other as they move through the game-world (offline play is also possible).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strangers you encounter could be either friend or foe - no distinctions in the game system between friendly and enemy players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvP Duel system with special UI and resource recovery after matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 combinable curses that alter gameplay significantly (the first tier unlocks after finishing the game).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meticulously designed interconnected world to explore, with a score by the musicians of the original Jump King.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leveling System with four dualities based on the classical Humours - providing extended replayability and player expression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a Smoking Hot Babe at The Top!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable player character with a unique visual style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.5D graphics that make the world of Jump King gain a new level of depth and immersion.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Plunge into high-stakes punishment platforming in JUMP KING QUEST! Explore alone or fall together in dynamic online climbing action as you fight your way upwards on an unhinged quest to The Smoking Hot Babe at The Top. In this world, every ledge is a battlefield…", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/aed715dc2f7d1df4bc9493b14e294a3d46b9e6c1/header.jpg?t=1782414623", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/5be1274e1f82783ea1a6dc650ee28b94e80b7191/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782414623", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317640/5be1274e1f82783ea1a6dc650ee28b94e80b7191/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782414623", "website": "https://nexile.se/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br>